Serves a release store for clients to update from, on the configured `serve.address`

Usage: leptoskit codepush serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --store <STORE>  The release store directory; defaults to `releases/` [default: releases]
      --dir <DIR>      The static directory served next to the update API [default: dist]
      --port <PORT>    The port to serve on; defaults to 4100
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
